{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haruka had been steadily building her career as the popular virtual streamer <i>Riruri Tachibana</i>.<br>One day, while livestreaming a horror game as usual, a strange glitch flickered across the screen, followed by a sudden blackout\u2014the stream was abruptly cut off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After that, her PC went silent with a blue screen and couldn\u2019t be rebooted.<br>Though she apologized to her viewers and moved on by purchasing a new PC, things slowly began to go\u2026 wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person horror adventure game.<br>Players take on the role of <i>Haruka</i>, the person behind the virtual streamer <i>Riruri Tachibana</i>, as she becomes entangled in a series of unsettling events in the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds through exploration, dialogue, and streaming segments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror game inspired by Japanese virtual streamers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person walking simulator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced in Japanese</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approx. 1 to 2 hours to see all endings (multi-ending format)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streaming Guidelines</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permission:</strong> Streaming of this game is allowed for both individuals and organizations without prior approval.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monetization:</strong> Revenue generation throug